# Line endings, settled once. Added 21 September 2026 (E-18).
# Store LF, check out LF, so a Windows shell and a Cowork Linux mount cannot
# disagree about a file nobody edited. Without this, `git status` over the
# mount reports tracked files as modified and buries real changes in CRLF noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Executed by Windows tooling, which wants CRLF.
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.cmd   text eol=crlf
*.ps1   text eol=crlf

# Named explicitly: a corrupted image is a silent failure. SVG is text.
*.png   binary
*.pdf   binary
